          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Answer the examiner’s questions about yourself, nature and your friends."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "What’s your name?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 1.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "How old are you?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 2
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Where do you live?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 1.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "Now, let’s talk about nature. What is your favourite time of the year?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "How often do you look at the stars in the sky?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.1
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Now, please tell me something about a day you spent in a park.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "Now, let’s talk about your friends. How often do you chat to your friends online?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "When was the last time you had a meal with a friend?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q1-t8.mp3",
                  "seconds": 3.8
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 30,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "s2",
      "part": 2,
      "label": "Part 2",
      "instruction": "Look at the pictures and talk about them with your partner. Then answer the examiner’s questions.",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "q2",
          "number": 2,
          "points": 15,
          "skills": [],
          "material": [
            {
              "id": "i1",
              "type": "imageRef",
              "image": "img1"
            }
          ],
          "interaction": {
            "kind": "speaking",
            "prompt": [
              {
                "t": "text",
                "v": "Look at the pictures of different jobs people do. Talk about them with your partner: say if you like them and why or why not. Then answer the examiner’s questions."
              }
            ],
            "turns": [
              {
                "id": "t1",
                "text": "Here are some pictures that show different jobs people do. Do you like these different jobs people do? Say why or why not.",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t1.mp3",
                  "seconds": 9.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t10",
                "text": "Being a pilot is exciting. You can visit lots of countries. Would you like to be a pilot?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t10.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t11",
                "text": "I love music, so I’d like to be a musician. Do you play an instrument?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t11.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t12",
                "text": "Being a doctor is a difficult job, but doctors help lots of people. What do you think?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t12.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t13",
                "text": "My mum is a teacher. She says it’s interesting but tiring. Do you want to be a teacher?",
                "role": "partner",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t13.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.1
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t2",
                "text": "Do you think working as a pilot is exciting? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t2.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t3",
                "text": "Do you think working as a musician is fun? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t3.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.9
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t4",
                "text": "Do you think working as a doctor is difficult? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t4.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.8
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t5",
                "text": "Do you think working as a cleaner is boring? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t5.mp3",
                  "seconds": 5.7
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t6",
                "text": "Do you think working as a teacher is interesting? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t6.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t7",
                "text": "So, which of these different jobs do you like best?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t7.mp3",
                  "seconds": 4.6
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t8",
                "text": "Now, would you like to work in a different country in the future? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t8.mp3",
                  "seconds": 7.5
                }
              },
              {
                "id": "t9",
                "text": "Do you think it’s good to earn a lot of money in a job? Why? / Why not?",
                "audio": {
                  "src": "assets/ket3/ket3-t1-s-q2-t9.mp3",
                  "seconds": 6.3
                }
              }
            ],
            "maxSeconds": 45,
            "scoring": "judge"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
